    "body": "<p><img data-src=\"https://example.invalid/1.jpg\" data-w=\"1000\" data-ratio=\"0.75\"></p><p>吉林白山。</p><p><img data-src=\"https://example.invalid/2.jpg\" data-w=\"1000\" data-ratio=\"0.75\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#888\">吉林珲春。</span></p><p><img data-src=\"https://example.invalid/3.jpg\" data-w=\"1000\" data-ratio=\"0.75\"></p><inherit style=\"display:block\">黑龙江虎林。</inherit><p><img data-src=\"https://example.invalid/4.jpg\" data-w=\"1000\" data-ratio=\"0.75\"></p><inherit style=\"display:block\">拍摄：示例作者。</inherit><p><img data-src=\"https://example.invalid/5.jpg\" data-w=\"1000\" data-ratio=\"0.75\"></p><p>绥芬河。</p>",
    "expected": {"images": 5, "captions": ["吉林白山。", "吉林珲春。", "黑龙江虎林。", "拍摄：示例作者。", "绥芬河。"], "headings": []}
  },
